@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Local Deployment — Docker Compose
node "Developer machine" {
  node "Docker Compose network" {
    node "frontend container" {
      artifact "Static server + proposed reverse proxy" as SPA
    }
    node "backend container" {
      artifact "Spring Boot executable JAR" as API
    }
    database "PostgreSQL container" as DB
  }
  actor "Browser" as B
}
B --> SPA : HTTP localhost frontend port
SPA --> API : /api/v1 via reverse proxy
API --> DB : JDBC internal network / pool

note right of API
Flyway runs at backend startup.
Database readiness gates backend; backend readiness checked.
External dev-only JWT key configuration, not baked into image.
No external banking dependencies.
end note
note bottom
Production hosting is outside MVP scope.
Ports and proxy choice finalized in Compose spec.
Reverse proxy routes /api/v1; it is not an API Gateway.
Future: stateless replicas behind HTTPS load balancer; not local MVP.
end note
@enduml
